Description: core: stereo3d_unpack judges the views by the producer's own frame
 Whether a side by side or top and bottom frame holds half or whole views is told by
 the producer (meta.media.stereo3d.views) or, when it says nothing, judged by the
 players' shared rule from the frame's shape. The filter judged the frame it was
 given: in a player (Kdenlive's clip monitor) that is the clip fitted to the
 monitor's profile, so an unmarked 3840x1080 clip given its packing by the person
 was a letterboxed 1920x1080 frame, judged as half views, and each eye was shown
 twice as wide. The rule now reads the producer's own frame (meta.media.width,
 meta.media.height, aspect_ratio) when the producer has one.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Forwarded: not-yet
Last-Update: 2026-11-21

--- a/src/modules/core/filter_stereo3d_unpack.c
+++ b/src/modules/core/filter_stereo3d_unpack.c
@@ -104,6 +104,19 @@ static int full_views(mlt_frame frame, p
                  : packing == packing_top_and_bottom ? STEREO_POLICY_LAYOUT_TOP_AND_BOTTOM
                                                      : STEREO_POLICY_LAYOUT_SIDE_BY_SIDE_QUINCUNX;
     double sar = mlt_frame_get_aspect_ratio(frame);
+    // The shape that says half or whole views is the producer's own frame: a player's frame (a monitor's, fitted to its profile
+    // with bars) is not. A 3840x1080 clip in a 1920x1080 monitor is a letterboxed 1920x1080 frame of two whole views.
+    if (original) {
+        mlt_properties op = MLT_PRODUCER_PROPERTIES(original);
+        const int ow = mlt_properties_get_int(op, "meta.media.width");
+        const int oh = mlt_properties_get_int(op, "meta.media.height");
+        if (ow > 1 && oh > 1) {
+            width = ow;
+            height = oh;
+            const double oar = mlt_properties_get_double(op, "aspect_ratio");
+            sar = oar > 0 ? oar : 1.0;
+        }
+    }
     int sar_num = sar > 0 ? (int) (sar * 10000 + 0.5) : 0;
     return stereo_policy_video_views(width, height, sar_num, 10000, 0, 0, STEREO_POLICY_UPSAMPLED_UNKNOWN, layout, NULL) == 1;
 #else
